	ida_struct.set_member_cmt(ida_struct.get_member(struc, 227960), '''String: "What\'s up Coach, I\'ve been using this app to track my shooting workouts outside of practice and it\'s honestly helped a lot. I can see my progress, track my percentages, and it keeps me motivated to get better.\n\nI just saw they launched a Teams program where you can track all of our stats, assign weekly goals, watch our workout videos, and leave feedback in the app. I think it could really help us stay accountable and improve as a team.\n\nA lot of trainers and facilities are using it for one-on-ones too to improve their sessions. You should check it out—I think it could be huge for us whenever you\'re ready to try it.\n\nhttps://www.kourtai.app/teams"''', True)
